             <see cref="P:Azure.Storage.Files.Shares.ChangeFeed.ShareChangeFeedResetPolicy.ThrowOnReset" />; streaming APIs
             (<see cref="M:Azure.Storage.Files.Shares.ChangeFeed.ShareChangeFeedClient.GetChanges" /> and
             <see cref="M:Azure.Storage.Files.Shares.ChangeFeed.ShareChangeFeedClient.GetChanges(System.String)" /> plus their async counterparts)
             default to <see cref="P:Azure.Storage.Files.Shares.ChangeFeed.ShareChangeFeedResetPolicy.ContinueOnReset" />.
            
             Explicitly setting this property applies the chosen policy to every method on the
             client, overriding the per-API smart default.
